Respect and anti-ableism and anti-racism
As a school, we are committed to a practice of combatting bigotry of all kinds. Two types of prejudice that easily sneak their way into classrooms are ableism and racism. It is our task to confront these ideas whenever they occur and use our voices and actions to do so.
