Grading Policy: How is my work graded?
We will be using standards based grading this year.  That means we are looking for evidence that you learned the items listed above in the Student Outcomes section.  You will be able to show evidence of your learning in a variety of ways: classwork, discussions, projects, quizzes, and games.
When you show evidence of your learning, you’re work will be evaluated using this scale:
4 - Exceeds expectation
3 - Meets expectations
2 - Approaching expectations
1 - No evidence of learning
